xt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12043$7E3DD965-79F5-4F31-9FA4-3DEDABEB7ADA", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "e57265cfb928c5333c5980749bc35826cd3a9a44", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 66, "id": "Q66"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12043$FD1A0EA8-A980-4E58-A182-788E305F61E1", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "199f80fd3f85af90bc3dcb77cad8e838c08ec897", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 71, "id": "Q71"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12043$B5968513-825C-4256-A7E4-3E9D41B6C8C7", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "b7eaa6e89507dc6b54c3c4ba19db93a147ce8a6f", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1386, "id": "Q1386"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12043$2528E9D9-0975-4072-92FC-5BFCBF348D8D", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "c7e1e1023400f659b211fe58b5adf4a1a7e6634e", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1386, "id": "Q1386"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12043$A72BAECD-0E6B-46CF-A6D6-B8DEA85F5639", "rank": "normal"}], "P19": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P19", "hash": "5a4c939c638139b11fe83f08a207acbe50646680", "datavalue": {"value": "Yeah. We are perfect. Who's so smart that they could say that this is imperfect? Compared to what? It's perfect. Got cracks and holes in it and it's perfect. Thelonius Monk said to me once at this session, \"Don't be so perfect.\" He meant -- I said to Max, \"You know what Thelonius said to me? He said don't be so perfect. He means make a mistake.\" I didn't understand what either one of them were ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12043$0C28472F-0108-41CE-A5BD-1716C6469CDA", "rank": "normal"}]}}